# reflow2 keeps a live database here. The design belongs in git as an export,
# never as the running store — it holds locks and log segments that mean
# nothing on another machine.
.reflow2/

# NOTE: kit/*.wav IS committed, deliberately.
# GitHub Pages serves the repository as-is with no build step, so a generated
# file that has to ship has to be in the repository. The forge remains the
# source of truth — the recipes are in js/dsp.js, and `node forge/build-kit.mjs`
# regenerates these byte-for-byte. Never hand-edit them.

node_modules/

# Rendered demos — forge/demo.mjs and forge/calm.mjs. Several megabytes each,
# and both regenerate in seconds from js/dsp.js and js/ethereal.js.
*.wav
!kit/*.wav
